                    <ref target="#d97">Document 97</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d101-f5" n="5" xml:id="d101-f5-content">
                <p>On December 29 Hartman sent a memorandum to the Deputy Secretary of Defense, the
                    President’s Assistant for National Security Affairs, the Director of Central
                    Intelligence, the Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff, the Under Secretary of
                    the Treasury, the Under Secretary of Commerce, and the Special Trade
                    Representative explaining Kissinger’s request. (National Archives, RG 59, S/S
                    Files: Lot 81 D 309, Under Secretaries’ Memoranda, NSC–U/SM 91)</p>
            </note>
